# A failed pipe write in the HLS worker thread ends the worker loop, signals OBS_OUTPUT_ERROR and deactivates.
# DEFECT (reference): deactivate() joins the mux thread, and here it runs ON that thread (self join, which fails
# with EDEADLK and is ignored). Required behaviour: no self join; the thread just ends. The pipe write is the one
# of the first queued packet: header (writes 1,2) is written by the caller, packet info is write 3.
reset
output h service
venc h264 bitrate=2500 extra=0a0b keyint_sec=1
service https://i.example/live k
create hls
start
knob write_fail_at 3
knob err_text sink_gone
pkt v dts=0 key=1 data=0000000165aa
state
pump 5
state
state_hls
